[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5273591304","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121504#issuecomment-5273591304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121504","id":5273591304,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOlSeCA","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:37:38Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:40:07Z","body":"I have reviewed this, as part of my deep dive into the BVH.\r\n\r\n* I have tested this on my own game\r\n* I have also tested it with some additional multithreaded BVH features that I am developing myself\r\n* I have tested it with the guards turned on and off\r\n* I have also reviewed [[3.x] Minor BVH correctness fixes - #121501](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121501)\r\n\r\nAll the changes look good by my analysis (I have followed the path of each function), and the additional guards are essential to finish the work. These new mutex locks do not look to be used in any hot paths. The BVH internally uses their unguarded versions.\r\n\r\nThe two other minor clean ups aren't doing anything negative, and may well help some compilers (beyond my experience). \r\n\r\nSo IMO, this should be merged, as the `BVH_THREAD_SAFE` feature is being used, but only half finished.\r\n\r\n*There is another discussion to be had on why BVH_THREAD_SAFE is turned on*","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5273591304/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5276658330","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121504#issuecomment-5276658330","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121504","id":5276658330,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOoNqmg","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T06:15:33Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T06:19:33Z","body":"> There is another discussion to be had on why BVH_THREAD_SAFE is turned on\r\n\r\nYes, it could be that there is thread protection for some uses of BVH at a higher level, in which case it might not be needed. With lack of a physics maintainer having high level overview here, that's hard for me to say, but anyone is welcome to investigate / PR this, it's just a template switch.\r\n\r\nIn particular, in physics, there are user query functions (which might be isolated over the server boundary, but they could be instant returning), which might be worth checking for race conditions here, even if the physics itself doesn't use BVH from different threads. You can check empirically for contention BTW with `try_lock()`, I have a feeling we did get contention at the time it was first added to 4.x.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5276658330/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5296107858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121504#issuecomment-5296107858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121504","id":5296107858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO6wxUg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","ev